{"id":"steam-828570","steam":828570,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Canvas","summary":"Navigate a mysterious world with painting as your guide. Unlock abilities, grow plants, meet characters, discover new worlds, and confront the mad mage to free yourself.","about":"Paint the mysterious world to discover its secrets.\n\nNavigate a massive world that reacts to your paint.\n\nCarefully explore a dangerous and decarying world. Discover what you can paint to fill in the world, solve puzzles, and fix what's been broken.\n\nUnlock and upgrade unique abilities.\n\nDiscover powerful relics that give you new abilities. Crystals can be channeled to empower greater exploration into new lands.\n\nLearn from citizens in an unknowable world.\n\nBuild relationships with hidden characters, help them with quests, trade with them, and learn important information for your journey.\n\nFind and confront the Mad Mage, Vatii.\n\nExplore every corner of the map to unlock the hidden realm of the Mad Mage. If you've gained enough resources, relics, and knowledge of the game world you can defeat him and finally escape this crystalline prison.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/d08f5452f18241a0b110cd685d01332123fc5478/library_600x900.jpg?t=1739514816","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/header.jpg?t=1739514816","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/fc6dfb11f5a53fd2a22807545a415de3a67c506d/library_hero.jpg?t=1739514816","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/header.jpg?t=1739514816","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1739514816","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/ss_12260b71d2779549705031b5ba44fa1a86c06d1d.600x338.jpg?t=1739514816","full":"https://shared.aka